<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="legal-page">

    <div class="legal-container legal-content">

        <div class="legal-header">

            <span class="legal-label">
                YOUR PRIVACY
            </span>

            <h1>
                Privacy Policy
            </h1>

            <p>
                Your privacy matters to us. This Privacy Policy explains
                how CampusNear handles information when you use our platform.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>

            <p>
                CampusNear is a platform designed to help students discover
                nearby PGs, hostels, cafes, messes, laundry services and
                other useful services around their college campus.
            </p>

            <p>
                By using CampusNear, you agree to the practices described
                in this Privacy Policy.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

            <p>
                Depending on how you use CampusNear, we may collect
                information such as:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Name and email address when you create an account.</li>
                <li>Information submitted while creating a listing.</li>
                <li>Location or college information used to find nearby services.</li>
                <li>Reviews, feedback and other information you voluntarily provide.</li>
                <li>Basic technical information required to operate the website.</li>
            </ul>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>

            <p>
                Information collected through CampusNear may be used to:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Provide and improve CampusNear services.</li>
                <li>Display relevant listings near a selected college.</li>
                <li>Maintain and manage user accounts.</li>
                <li>Process and display listings submitted by users.</li>
                <li>Respond to support requests and feedback.</li>
                <li>Improve website security and performance.</li>
            </ul>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>4. Location Information</h2>

            <p>
                CampusNear may use location-related information to help
                identify services located near a selected college or
                location.
            </p>

            <p>
                Location information is used to provide relevant search
                results and improve the CampusNear experience.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>5. Information Sharing</h2>

            <p>
                We do not sell your personal information. Information may
                be shared only when necessary to operate the platform,
                provide requested services, comply with legal requirements,
                or protect the security and rights of CampusNear and its users.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>

            <p>
                CampusNear may use third-party services such as hosting,
                mapping, authentication, database, analytics or image
                storage providers. These services may process information
                according to their own privacy policies.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>7. Data Security</h2>

            <p>
                We take reasonable measures to protect information handled
                through the platform. However, no internet-based service
                can guarantee complete security of information.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>

            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
                Changes will be reflected on this page.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="legal-section">

            <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>

            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please
                contact us through our
                <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> page.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-note">

            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>

            <p>
                This Privacy Policy is intended as a general website policy
                for CampusNear and should be reviewed and customized
                according to the final services, data practices and legal
                requirements of the deployed application.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>